{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"二元一次方程组与一次函数的几何意义","goals":["理解二元一次方程与一次函数的对应关系及图像交点的几何意义","掌握通过代入验证两条直线交点坐标的方法","理解平行线无交点与方程组无解的对应关系"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["通过直角坐标系直观演示两条相交直线的交点","代入计算进行代数与几何的双向验证","对比平行直线说明无解的几何本质"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":1,"min":-5,"max":5,"label":"k1"},{"as":"number_02","initial":1,"min":-5,"max":5,"label":"b1"},{"as":"number_03","initial":-1,"min":-5,"max":5,"label":"k2"},{"as":"number_04","initial":3,"min":-5,"max":5,"label":"b2"}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-01","purpose":"在坐标系中展示直线y=x+1与y=-x+3并观察交点","beats":[{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"我们在同一平面直角坐标系中画出两条直线，第一条是 y = x + 1，第二条是 y = -x + 3。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"plot","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"两直线的交点与几何意义","axes":{"x":{"min":-4,"max":4,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-4,"max":8,"label":"y"}},"curves":[{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:primary-curve","expression":"((number_01)*(x))+(number_02)","label":"直线 ①"},{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:curve-02","expression":"((number_03)*(x))+(number_04)","label":"直线 ②"}],"points":[{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:intersection","x":1,"y":2,"label":"交点 ({x}, {y})"}],"bindings":[{"target":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:intersection.x","expression":"((number_04)-(number_02))/((number_01)-(number_03))","hide_when_undefined":true},{"target":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01:fragment:intersection.y","expression":"((number_01)*(((number_04)-(number_02))/((number_01)-(number_03))))+(number_02)","hide_when_undefined":true}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:1:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\begin{cases} y = x + 1 \\\\ y = -x + 3 \\end{cases}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:1:1:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察两条直线的图像与位置关系"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"仔细观察可以发现，这两条直线在坐标系中相交于一点，交点坐标是 (1, 2)。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:1:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"直线的交点","items":["直线 y = x + 1 与 y = -x + 3 相交于点 (1, 2)","交点坐标同时满足两个函数解析式"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-02"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:1:2:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-02","purpose":"通过代入验证交点(1,2)同时满足两个方程","beats":[{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"观察坐标系，两条直线相交于点 (1, 2)。接下来，我们将这个点的坐标分别代入两个一次函数解析式中进行验证。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:2:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"引导关注两条直线的交点(1,2)"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:2:1:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"首先代入第一个函数 y = x + 1。当 x 等于 1 时，y 等于 1 加 1 等于 2，左边等于右边，满足第一个方程。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:2:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"2 = 1 + 1"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"再代入第二个函数 y = -x + 3。当 x 等于 1 时，y 等于 -1 加 3 也等于 2，同样满足第二个方程。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:2:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"2 = -1 + 3"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-02:beat:moment-04","narration":{"text":"这说明交点 (1, 2) 的坐标同时满足这两个方程，它就是对应二元一次方程组的公共解。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:2:4:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\begin{cases} x = 1 \\\\ y = 2 \\end{cases}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-03","purpose":"总结二元一次方程组与直线交点的几何对应关系","beats":[{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们来总结二元一次方程组与直线的几何对应关系：求解二元一次方程组的公共解，在几何上就等价于寻找两条直线图像的交点坐标。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:3:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-03-moment-01-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"二元一次方程组与直线的几何意义","items":["方程组的公共解 ⇔ 两条直线的交点坐标","方程组无解 ⇔ 两直线平行（无交点）","方程组有无数解 ⇔ 两直线重合"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-02-moment-04-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:3:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"总结二元一次方程组与直线交点的几何对应关系"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-04","purpose":"观察平行线无交点并理解方程组无解的情况","beats":[{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我们来看另一组直线：y = x + 1 和 y = x - 2。它们的斜率都是1，因而在平面上是两条互相平行的直线。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:4:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\begin{cases} y = x + 1 \\\\ y = x - 2 \\end{cases}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-03-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:4:1:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-04-moment-01-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"\\text{平行线 } \\Leftrightarrow \\text{ 无交点 } \\Leftrightarrow \\text{ 方程组无解}"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-04-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2-region"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:4:1:3","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01"],"intent":"观察两条斜率相同的平行线"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:4:1:4","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_03","to":1,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}},{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:4:1:5","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_04","to":-2,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:step:section-04:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"因为两条直线平行且永不相交，所以它们没有任何公共点。这也对应着该二元一次方程组没有任何解，也就是无解的情况。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:action:4:2:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["linear-simultaneous-intersections-0.1.2:node:section-04-moment-01-item-02"],"intent":"继续观察当前画面"}}]}}]}}
